{"id": "119919", "name": "אינטגרציה בחלקים – xⁿ·ln(x)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו, ואל תשכחו את הקבוע</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">אינטגרציה בחלקים</b><br>ניתן להשתמש באינטגרציה בחלקים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u = {{CT:2}}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(dv = {{CT:3}}d{{CT:1}}\\)</span>. אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(du = {{CT:4}}d{{CT:1}}\\)</span> ו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v = {{CT:5}}\\)</span>. ונקבל<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:0}}d{{CT:1}} &= \\int udv \\\\ &= uv - \\int vdu \\\\ &= {{CT:2}}\\cdot \\left({{CT:5}}\\right) - \\int {{CT:5}}\\cdot \\left({{CT:4}}\\right)d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &= {{CT:6}} - \\int {{CT:7}}d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &= {{CT:6}} - {{CT:8}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה חלקית</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nvarss:delete(C,delete(c,varss));\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);\n\nta2:1/(rdm+1)*v^(rdm+1)*ln(abs(v))-1/(rdm+1)^2*v^(rdm+1)+c;\ndta2:ev(diff(ta2,v));\n\nstu:ev(diff(an1,v));\nc1:ev(diff(an1,c));\nc2:ev(diff(an1,C));\nd:c1^2+c2^2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu", "tans": "p", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "d", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu", "tans": "dta2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "rdm", "v"], "nvariants": 5}